{"server":"jp","storyId":"story_peper_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_peper_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"傭兵の少女","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_peper_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"a3e3563ca5cc72d0028a727db6dbb963bc4d00ec81eb5b4d575a7770ea87e186","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"パプリカの所属する傭兵小隊は、ロンディニウムへと向かう旅路の途中である。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"どうだ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"まだついて来てやがるぜ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"あのガキの頑固さはあんたもよく知ってるだろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傭兵隊長","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……もう一度説得してもらえるか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"グリン、あんたマジで耄碌しちまったようだな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"今更後悔するくらいなら、何であの時あいつを連れ出したんだよ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"やかましい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"あの闇市の依頼は問題が大きすぎたんだ。金持ち二人が互いの死を望むほどの有様だ。荷物が消えた今、奴らが俺たちに責任を被せるのは確定だ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"もしあの小娘を街に置き去りにしたなら、死期が早まっていただけだろうが。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"それは分かるけどよ、連れ出しといて今更追い払っても、あいつに行くあてなんかねぇだろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……道中で町が見つかれば、働いて生きていけるはずだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"あんた、本当に今の自分の言葉を信じてんのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"マジな話さ、あいつのためを思うんならもっと鍛えてやった方がいいぞ。まだ人が殺されてるとこ見たことないだろ？　角獣を二、三頭狩るとかそんなんじゃなく、もっとガチなことをさせるべきだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"グリン、そろそろ現実を見ろ。俺たちはもうロンディニウムへの道を踏み出してるんだぞ。お前が嫌がったって、もう避けて通れねぇことなんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"あいつだってサルカズなんだからよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……もういい。少し黙ってろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"言われなくても分かってる。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"バカバカ、あんの大バカめ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"またうちを子供扱いしやがって。いつか後悔させてやっからな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"よお。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"――！　敵襲！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"ガチの敵襲だったら、お前とっくに死んでるぞ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ……もう、驚かさないでよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"お前を脅かしに来るほど暇じゃねぇよ。警戒心の薄いお前が勝手にビビっただけだろ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"そもそもうちは医療スタッフなんすから、戦闘はあんま得意じゃないんすよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"それにさっきは……考え事してたから、気づかなくて……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"まあ、そういうことにしといてやる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"何だ、まだグリンのこと怒ってんのか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……ふん、当然っすよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"こんなタイミングで出てけなんて、ひどすぎじゃないっすか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"そりゃ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"うちだって傭兵すよ。この小隊のれっきとしたメンバーなのに、何で追い出そうとすんの？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"どうしてうちをロンディニウムに連れていってくんないの？　一緒に何度も任務をこなしてきたじゃないっすか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"今回はいつもとはわけが違ぇんだよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"うちには同じに見えるけど……いつもよりも、ちょっと目的地が遠くて、報酬はたっぷりってだけじゃんか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"そりゃ、確かに……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"あの日、グリンが帰って来てすぐに出発するって言った時の様子が少し変だったんすけど。あんなに興奮してるとこ初めて見たし……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"あの人、いっつも全部どうでもいいって感じすけど、何だかあの時はちょっと様子が違ってたんす。次勝てば、これからはいい暮らしができるとか何とか言ってたし。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"あれってホントなんすかね？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"……知るかよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"とにかく俺は金が欲しいだけだ。それ以外は考えたこともねぇな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"それもそうすね。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"グリンはうちが何も知らないガキだと思ってるみたいすけど、傭兵なんて金さえ稼げれば十分じゃないすか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ばあちゃんさえ養えるんなら、どんな仕事だろうが全部同じようなもんすよ。別に他の事なんて分からなくたって……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ガチで大金が手に入るんなら……うちはばあちゃんのためにもっと良い家に移りたいっす。今住んでるとこは雨漏りが酷いし、冷えて膝が痛むってばあちゃんも言ってるから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ、そうだ。もしグリンがどうしても欲しいってんなら、いい感じの誕生日プレゼントなんかも買ってあげれるかも……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"お前、あいつの誕生祝いなんて考えてたのかよ？　自分の生まれた日がいつとか、あいつがそんなくだらねぇこと覚えてると思うか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"くだらねぇって何すか？　めちゃ意味のあることっすからね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"そうやって毎年自分に言い聞かせてやんないと、一年が過ぎたこととか、自分がまた一つ年を取ったこととかを、ホントに忘れちゃうかもしんないんすよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"それってすげー怖いことだと思わないっすか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"……かもな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"答えになってないじゃんか。いい加減すぎっすよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"お前にゃかなわねぇな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"まあ俺が思うに、今の話を直接グリンの野郎に聞かせてやりゃあ、あいつもうんと言うかもしれんが……いや、ますます一緒に連れていくのを拒む可能性もあるか。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"え？　どうして……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（チッ、元々はこいつを説得しに来たはずなんだがな……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"（まあいいか。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サルカズ傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"何でもねぇ。早く来いよ、俺は先に行くぞ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"何だよー。途中で話をやめるやつが一番嫌いなんだけど。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"何をコソコソしてんだか……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"相手はとっくにいなくなっていた。前方には約二十人ほどの隊伍が編成されている。パプリカの目に微かに映ったのは、その最後尾の人影のみだ。\n少女はしばし黙り込んでうつむくと、ポケットをまさぐって何かを取り出した。\nそれは毛糸で編まれた、鮮やかな色合いの指サックだった。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"グリンはきっと派手すぎるって言うだろうけど……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"そんなの関係ないし。派手すぎるくらいが一番綺麗だもん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"もしまた追い出すなんて言ったら……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"もうプレゼントなんて、渡してやんないかんな！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"──！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（何の音だろ？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……気のせいかな？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰だ！　出てこい！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ハッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"——!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当たった！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰だあんた、何が目的……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ、ちょっと──"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"待て……逃げんな！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_coldforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ハァ……ハァ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"お、追いついた……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闇市の追っ手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"……まさかこんな小娘が追いつくとな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……なら、こんな小娘に捕まったあんたはうち以下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"もう走れないっしょ。白状しなよ、あんた何モン！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闇市の追っ手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"ハッ、甘いなガキめ。まあ腕は悪くねぇようだ。サルカズってのはダテじゃねぇ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闇市の追っ手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"だがな……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闇市の追っ手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false,"text":"頭空っぽの甘ちゃんなんざ、どれだけ腕が良かろうが所詮はただのガキよ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"なっ……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（……ダメだパプリカ。向こうはわざと怒らせようとしてんだから……挑発に乗っちゃダメ。冷静にならなきゃ……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"言っとくけど、無駄話で時間稼ぎしようったって無駄だかんな……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"さっさと質問に答えな。じゃないと痛い目見るよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闇市の追っ手","speakerId":"avg_npc_007","isRemote":false