xt":"ここまでだ。茶番にはもう飽き飽きだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"覚えておけ小娘。これからもまだ俺たちについてくるつもりなら、いつか必ず手を汚さなきゃならん日が訪れることをな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"うん……分かってるっす……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"本当に分かってるのか？　そうは思えんがな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……俺たちについてくるのが、結果的にお前にとって害になるかもしれない……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"パプリカ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"ロンディニウムに行くのはやめておけ。お前には向いてない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"でも……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"次勝てば、これからはいい暮らしができるって、あんたが言ってたんじゃないすか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"うちは戦えるっす。きっと役に立ってみせるから！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"これは戦いだけの話じゃないんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"俺は今回の任務にすべてを賭けるつもりだ。なぜなら、俺はかつて見たことがあるんだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"見たって、何をっすか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"家を……帰る場所を持った俺たちサルカズの姿さ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"そこまで良いものじゃないかもしれんが、少しでも可能性があるのなら、俺はそのために全力を尽くしたい。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"だがお前は違う。お前にはまだ別の道がある。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"べ……別の道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"そんなの、分かんないっす……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"みんなと一緒に行く以外に、どんな道があるって言うんすか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確かにうちは町へ戻って、前みたいに暮らしたい……けど、そんなこと本当にできるんすか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcounty"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"実を言うと、考えてたことがあるんすよ……今回のロンディニウムでの任務は、これまでの任務よりもずっと厳しいものになる。それは間違いないっすよね？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"そうなるだろう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"グリンだって、いつかどこかで倒れて、命を失う日が来るかもしれないんすよね……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……だったら来年の誕生日プレゼントは用意しないっす。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"はいこれ、今年のプレゼント。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……指サックか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"派手すぎるだとか、時間の無駄だとか、いらないとかいう言葉は、受け付けないっすからね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"た、たとえあんたが死んだって、うちは悲しんだりはしないっす。約束するっすよ。サルカズにとっては、生きながらの別れも、死がもたらす別れも普通のことっすから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"けどもし死なずにいられるなら……こっぴどく殴られようが、報酬が手に入らなかろうが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全然構わないんで。無駄足に終わって金が貰えなくても、そんなの気にしないっす！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"うちはただ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"ただ任務が終わった後、みんなで一緒に帰れるんならそれで……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……甘い考えだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"今時のサルカズは皆お前のような甘ちゃんなのか？　俺の知ってるサルカズはそうじゃなかったがな。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"またお説教すか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"サルカズが身内の無事を願っちゃいけないって言うのかよ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"けど、うちはそう思ってるんだ……うちだってサルカズなんすよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"お前のようなサルカズはいつだって戦場ですぐに倒れる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"……俺はお前の死に様など見るつもりはないからな、小娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"グリン","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"行くぞ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"パプリカ","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"どういう意味すか……？　あっ、ちょっと待ってってば！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
